  "description": "<p>A LDP-RS that describes a LDP-NR advertises several HTTP methods as allowable that are, in fact, not allowable:</p>\n\n<p>curl -i localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/a/binary/fcr:metadata</p>\n\n<p>Allow: MOVE,COPY,DELETE,POST,HEAD,GET,PUT,PATCH,OPTIONS</p>\n\n<p>Clearly, POST is not allowed.</p>",
